      "text": "The parameters \u03b2 and \u03b3 interact to set an effective KL\npenalty. Small \u03b2 weakens the KL constraint and can drown\nout the shaped reward, while large \u03b2 risks over-sharpening\nthe policy. The product \u03b2\u03b3 determines the effective reward\nscale relative to the entropy regularization, allowing prac-\ntitioners to balance exploration and exploitation by tuning\nthese jointly. The pointwise maximizer is a Gibbs policy\n",
